meta {
  name: Get Folder
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/folders/{{folderId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  No workspaceId in the path: membership is resolved from the folder's own
  workspace.

  A folder that does not exist and a folder in someone else's workspace both
  return 404, so the id space cannot be probed. A malformed uuid returns 400.
}
